    "id": "superexam-surgery-0032",
    "subject": "surgery",
    "originalNumber": 32,
    "stem": "A 60-year-old man with newly diagnosed prostate\ncancer comes to see you. He underwent\ntransrectal ultrasonography with a needle biopsy\nshowing adenocarcinoma. Except for elevated PSA,\nhe is currently asymptomatic. The fi rst test to\norder in staging for his prostate cancer is:",
