    "explanation": "Paraphimosis is a common problem that\nrepresents a true medical emergency. When\nforeskin is retracted for prolonged periods,\nconstriction of the glans penis may ensue. This is\nparticularly likely in hospitalized patients who\nare confined to bed or who have altered\nmentation. Edema often forms in the genitals of\nsupine patients due to the dependent position of\nthat area. Patients with diminished\nconsciousness will not be aware of the penile\npain from paraphimosis, which may delay\nrecognition of the problem until too late. Delay\ncan be catastrophic as penile necrosis may occur\ndue to ischemia.",
