    "stem": "12. RP a movie actor was involved in a motor\nvehicular accident in Mandaue City which caused a\ntraffic standstill. RP sustained crushing injuries\nover his tibia and fibula and upon examination, he\nis unable to evert his foot. Based on the Seddon\nclassification, which of the following peripheral\nnerve injury patterns is present when there is\ndisruption of axons and endoneurial tubes?",
