    "explanation": "Page 23 of Topnotch Handout. This is a case of a\nMallory-weiss tear. Majority resolves\nspontaneously. However for this patient the best\ncourse of action would be endoscopic\ncoagulation of bleeders. If endoscopic tx fails,\nlaparotomy+ high gastrotomy + oversewing of\nthe tear is the next course of action.",
