    "explanation": "preoperative CT findings that determine\nunresectability of a pancreatic head mass\ninclude encasement of the SMA, celiac axis and\nocclusion of the superior mesenteric vein or\nportal vein. Loss of plane b/w tumor and the\nvessels is not a contraindication for curative\nresection.",
