    "explanation": "Type I - fusiform dilatation of the CBD -\ncholecystectomy, cyst excison and a roux en Y\ncholedochojejunostomy. Type II -diverticulum of\nCBD - excision. Type III- choledochocele of the\nintraduodenal CBD - sphincteroplasty or\ncholedochoduodenostomy. Type 4- caroli's\ndisease, cystic dilatations of intrahepatic duct, -\nliver transplantation.",
