    "stem": "A 60 year old male, asymptomatic and a known\ndiabetic, underwent an ultrasound of the whole\nabdomen as part of his executive checkup. There\nwere noted findings of cholelithiasis in the\nultrasound. What will be the best treatment option\nfor this patient?",
