    "subject": "surgery",
    "originalNumber": 361,
    "stem": "A 58M with a 3 week history of jaundice is brought\nto the ER because of lethargy. Upon seeing the\npatient, he is febrile (39.5C) and hypotensive\n(80/45) with RUQ pain. The initial management\nfor this patient would be?",
