    "explanation": "Each variable score 1, 2 or 3. Bilirubin <2\nmg/dL, 2–3 mg/dL, >3 mg/dL; albumin >3.5\ng/dL, 2.8–3.5 g/dL, <2.8 g/dL, PT INR <1.7, 1.7–\n2.2, >2.2; encephalopathy none, controlled,\nuncontrolled; ascites none, controlled,\nuncontrolled\nChild A 5-6\nChild B 7-9\nChild C 10-15 Schwartz 10th pg 1280",
