    "originalNumber": 373,
    "stem": "A 34/M smoker complains of recurrent headache\nand unilateral ear discharge with associated\nhearing loss. On PE, you noted matted lymph\nnodes in the posterior neck. What is the standard\ntreatment for this disorder?",
