    "id": "superexam-surgery-0441",
    "subject": "surgery",
    "originalNumber": 441,
    "stem": "A 45 year-old man presents with diaphoresis,\nheadache and palpitations. Imaging studies were\ndone which revealed a 3.5cm mass in his left\nadrenal gland. Laboratory examination revealed\nelevated urine metanephrines. The treatment of\nchoice for this patient is:",
