    "id": "superexam-surgery-0447",
    "subject": "surgery",
    "originalNumber": 447,
    "stem": "A 10 year-old child suffered fractures on his left\n10th and 11th ribs after a fall. He was noted of\nsigns of intraabdominal bleeding. An emergency\nexplore laparotomy was done revealing laceration\nof the lower pole of the spleen. The best\nmanagement for the above injury to the spleen is\nto:",
