    "id": "superexam-surgery-0474",
    "subject": "surgery",
    "originalNumber": 474,
    "stem": "While playing around the kitchen, a 5 year old\nchild accidentally bumps off to her mother\ncarrying a cup of hot coffee, spilling it over her\nbody sustaining burn injury as follows: anterior\ntrunk with partial thickness burn, right arm with\nfull thickness burn and right leg with superficial\nburn. What is the burn size?",
